              "id": "CVE-2026-59845-libssh-4",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-59845 medium vulnerability for libssh-4 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in libssh. When ProxyCommand is used, an unchecked fork() failure can be stored as process ID -1; during cleanup, signals may then be sent across the caller's accessible process tree, leading to local denial of service."
